BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:punch-out-weekdays@attendance-buddy
DTSTAMP:20261102T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Kolkata:20261102T180000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Kolkata:20261102T181000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO,TU,WE,TH,FR
SUMMARY:Punch out before you leave (biometric)
DESCRIPTION:Punch out on the biometric before you leave.\n9 h = full day. U
 nder 8 h = LOP. Only one punch = Incomplete (LOP).\nA punch-out counts unt
 il 11:59 PM.
